### List active roles
GET http://127.0.0.1:8020/api/roles

### Get Insurance Agent profile
GET http://127.0.0.1:8020/api/roles/insurance_agent/profile

### Get Agency Manager profile
GET http://127.0.0.1:8020/api/roles/agency_manager/profile

### Role-aware copilot context request
POST http://127.0.0.1:8020/api/copilot/context
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role_code": "campaign_manager",
  "question": "Which campaigns generated the highest policy conversion?"
}

